":"The nearest-neighbour tour from the first vertex (NetworkX "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"greedy_tsp"},{"type":"text","text":", JGraphT"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NearestNeighborHeuristicTSP(first)"},{"type":"text","text":", whose default starts at a random vertex): repeatedly"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the nearest unvisited vertex, the first in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order on ties, then back to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"start. LEMON’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NearestNeighborTsp"},{"type":"text","text":" shares the name only: it starts from the lightest edge"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and grows the path at both ends, a different procedure and tour."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Tours\/documentation\/Tours\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/nearestNeighborTour(weight:)"},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"nearestNeighborTour"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"W"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"weight"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Edges-swift.associatedtype","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Edges"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Index"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"W"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Walks\/documentation\/Walks\/Cycle","preciseIdentifier":"s:5Walks5CycleV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Cycle"},{"kind":"text","text":"